    <TD STYLE="white-space: nowrap">&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD COLSPAN="8" STYLE="text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">To approve a reverse stock split of the Company&rsquo;s ordinary shares, at a ratio of 1-for15, )the &ldquo;Reverse Stock Split&rdquo;), and authorize the Board of Directors to implement such reverse stock split at its discretion at any time prior to the one-year anniversary of this Extraordinary General Meeting, in order to regain compliance with Nasdaq Listing Rule 5550(a)(2), which requires listed securities to maintain a minimum bid price of US$1.00 per share.</FONT></TD></TR>
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
